  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saag paneer is fresh "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "paneer",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "paneer"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " fried golden and served in a smooth, spiced spinach sauce. The paneer is fried first to develop a crust that prevents it from becoming waterlogged when it goes into the sauce. The spinach is blanched and blended into the sauce rather than left as whole leaves, which gives a smooth, clinging result rather than a loose pile of greens."
          }
        ]
      },
